!Sample_type = SRA
!Sample_channel_count = 1
!Sample_source_name_ch1 = HAP1 cell
!Sample_organism_ch1 = Homo sapiens
!Sample_taxid_ch1 = 9606
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell line: HAP1 cell
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell type: near-haploid human cell line derived from the KBM-7 chronic myelogenous leukemia  cell line
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = treatment: PBS
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = HAP1 cells were cultured in Iscove’s Modified Dulbecco’s Medium (IMDM; Gibco) supplemented with 10% Fetal Bovine Serum (FBS; NEWZERUM) and 1% penicillin-streptomycin (Hyclone).
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = genomic DNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Genomic DNA (gDNA) was isolated using TIANamp Genomic DNA kits (#DP304, TIANGEN) according to the manufacturer’s protocol. The sgRNA sequences were amplified using High-Fidelity 2X PCR Master Mix (#M0541L, NEB). PCR products were gel extracted, quantified, mixed and sequenced.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Genomic DNA was randomly interrupted by A Covaris ultrasonic breaker. After the end repair, addition of A tail, addition of sequencing adapter, purification, and PCR amplification, the DNA library was prepared.
!Sample_data_processing = Sequencing Data Filtering
!Sample_data_processing = Enrichment of sgRNAs and genes was analyzed using MAGeCK (Version 0.5.9.2)
!Sample_data_processing = Assembly: Brunello Library (#73179, Addgen)
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary files format and content: tab-delimited text files include counts for each sgRNA
